<title>SINGAPORE: Winfoong buys more Hong Fok.</title>
<headline>Winfoong buys more Hong Fok.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's Winfoong Holdings Ltd has bought more shares in Singapore construction group Hong Fok Corporation Ltd, a Hong Fok statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said Winfoong bought 344,000 Hong Fok shares at an average price of Singapore $2.54605 each on April 14.</p>
<p>The purchase increased Winfoong's stake in Hong Fok to 22.17 percent or 30.23 million shares from 21.91 percent previously.</p>
<p>Hong Fok in turn also has an interest of over 15 percent in Winfoong.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
